# FlowTree — Usuários (módulo `users`; admin passa)

@host = http://localhost:5100/api
@token = COLE_O_TOKEN_AQUI
@userUuid = COLE_O_UUID_DO_USUARIO

### Listar usuários (paginado)
GET {{host}}/users?page=1
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Buscar por nome/e-mail
GET {{host}}/users?search=dev
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Criar usuário (com módulos)
POST {{host}}/users
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Maria Dev",
  "email": "maria@flowtree.test",
  "password": "password",
  "position": "Desenvolvedora",
  "is_admin": false,
  "is_active": true,
  "module_slugs": ["tasks"]
}

### Detalhar usuário
GET {{host}}/users/{{userUuid}}
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Atualizar usuário (campos opcionais; password só se enviada)
PUT {{host}}/users/{{userUuid}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Maria Dev Sênior",
  "position": "Tech lead",
  "is_active": true
}

### Sincronizar módulos do usuário
PUT {{host}}/users/{{userUuid}}/modules
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "module_slugs": ["tasks", "settings"]
}

### Excluir usuário (não pode ser o próprio → 422)
DELETE {{host}}/users/{{userUuid}}
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Usuários atribuíveis a cards (módulo tasks — lista enxuta)
GET {{host}}/assignable-users
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
